from \"semi-rare\" to \"rare\".</li>\n<li>With the Summer 2025 Update, this creature's classification in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Cyclopedia\">Cyclopedia's</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bestiary%2FClasses\">Bestiary</a> was changed from <a href=\"#/wiki/Bestiary%2FClasses\">Slime</a> to <a href=\"#/wiki/Bestiary%2FClasses\">Inkborn</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 31 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Platinum Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Platinum_Coin_c8a106.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-9</td>\n<td>5.7</td>\n<td class=\"\" data-sort-value=\"90.322581\" style=\"text-align:center;\">90%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Crystal%20Shard\"><img alt=\"Violet Crystal Shard\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Violet_Crystal_Shard_55dfa2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Violet%20Crystal%20Shard\">Violet Crystal Shard</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-4</td>\